# Dict key evaluation scope: computed keys evaluate in parent scope, not dict scope.
# $x is used as a computed dict key ([$x: 1]).
# The key expression $x evaluates in parent scope where x is NOT bound,
# so this raises E002 undefined variable: x.
[$x: 1]
=== error
[E002] undefined variable: x (did you mean the string "x"? Use quotes.) (defined at 4:2-4:4)
